---
kind: lore
id: bonds.bram
title: Bram, the Anvil (SR)
---

<beat id="bramIntro" on="summon" target="hero.bram" once="user" priority="10">
  @bram{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: HA! Summoned! Nobody's summoned me since the war. Where's the forge?
  @bram{code="0020"}: This is Doris. Doris is a hammer. Say hello to Doris.
</beat>

<beat id="bramDupe" on="summon" target="hero.bram" once="false" priority="3" when="holds('owned', ['bram']) && occasion.payload.copies <= 6">
  @bram{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Another me! Good. One of us can nap while the other hammers.
</beat>

<beat id="bramTap" on="homeTap" target="hero.bram" once="day">
  @bram{code="0010"}: Doris says your sword's gone dull. Doris is rarely wrong.
</beat>

<beat id="bramBirthday" on="dailyReset" once="day" when="holds('celebrate', ['bram'])">
  @bram{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: A cake! With candles! Stand back, I'll light them with the forge.
  @lumi{code="0010" emotion="surprised"}: Please do not light them with the forge.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="bramR1" who="bram" rank="r1" vow="Doris likes you. That's rare. Don't waste it." instance="use-001">
  @bram{code="0010"}: You want to know about Doris. Everyone does, eventually.
  @bram{code="0020" emotion="sad"}: My father made her. Last thing he made before the Hollow King took the light out of his eyes.
  @bram{code="0030"}: So I keep her loud. Every strike, so he can hear it wherever he is.
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="bramR2" who="bram" rank="r2" prev="bonds.bram.bramR1" vow="Whatever breaks, bring it to me. Even if it's you." instance="use-002">
  @bram{code="0010"}: I made you something. Don't laugh.
  @narrator{code="0010"}: It is a small iron star, a little lopsided, still warm.
  <branch id="bramR2Gift" prompt="Bram waits, very red.">
    <choice id="wear" label="Wear it at once.">
      @bram{code="0020" emotion="happy"}: HA! It suits you! Doris, it suits them!
    </choice>
    <choice id="lopsided" label="It's lopsided.">
      @bram{code="0030" emotion="angry"}: It's CHARACTER. Stars aren't round, they're... honest.
    </choice>
  </branch>
</beat>

<beat use="bondStory" id="bramR3" who="bram" rank="r3" prev="bonds.bram.bramR2" vow="Bram of the Anvil. Your blade, your shield, your very loud friend." instance="use-003">
  @bram{code="0010"}: I heard him today. My father. In the ring of the anvil.
  @bram{code="0020" emotion="sad"}: Probably just the metal. Probably.
  @bram{code="0030" emotion="happy"}: Doesn't matter. I'm keeping it loud. You're keeping me company.
</beat>
